Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Mga Direktor: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 15{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kalimutan ang pangalang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit sila biglang\Nnagpalit ng doktor at nurses niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Binabugbog ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang lalaking iyon ay fiancé ni Ms. Hong,\Nand ay nakausap niya ang direktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-donate din siya ng isang tonelada sa foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi sa amin ng direktor na itikom ang aming mga bibig,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,o kung hindi, kami ay idemanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ang ibang lalaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi ba fiancé niya?\N- Ewan ko ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipinapahayag niya na fiancé din niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder kung sino ang totoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,sinundan ako ng dati kong asawa dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.37,0:04:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Patuloy siyang nagtanong\Nyou bago ang operasyon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,upang baguhin ang iyong kalooban.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre tumanggi ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Naaksidente kami bago ang operasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.26,0:04:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang trak ang bumangga sa aming sasakyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala akong siya ang nasa likod nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi.\N- Hindi magdadalawang-isip si Baek Hyun-woo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,na gumawa ng kahit ano kapag siya ay may sama ng loob.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming beses niya akong binantaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.52,0:04:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kami nakaligtas sa pag-crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mabuti na lang at wala kami sa sasakyan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,pero akala ko ikaw, kaya nasaktan ang kamay ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,, sinusubukang basagin ang bintana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.00,0:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko lang itigil na makitang pinahihirapan ka niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nang nagkaroon siya ng relasyon at gustong hiwalayan ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.93,0:05:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,sinubukan mong kitilin ang sarili mong buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.98,0:05:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinubukan kong magpakamatay dahil sa isang\Nguy na nanloko sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakaawa ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi naman. Masyado kang malambot ang puso at mabait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong magawa noon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil kasal ka pa, pero hindi na.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Pananatilihin kitang ligtas, anuman ang mangyari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang hintuan ng bus malapit sa Sambang Reservoir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw 'yan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.18,0:05:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit nandoon ka sa oras ng kanyang kamatayan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Napagkasunduan naming magkita, pero hindi na siya nagpakita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kung gayon bakit natagpuan ang iyong buhok...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,sa kotse ng biktima?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:05:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala ako na ito ay nakatanim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita namin itong kutsilyo malapit sa pinangyarihan ng krimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon itong fingerprints at dugo niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.63, Default,,0,0,0,,Tugma sa talim ang kanyang mga sugat na nabutas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Magpapakatanga ka pa ba?\N- Kung ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,talagang ginamit ang kutsilyong iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,tapos iiwan ko ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakuha mo ba ang pinsalang iyon sa pananaksak sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Naaksidente ako sa Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaktan ko ang sarili ko habang sinusubukan\N na basagin ang bintana ng kotse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung nakuha ko ito dahil nadulas ang kamay ko habang ginagamit ang kutsilyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,nasa palad ko ang hiwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.64,0:06:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi sa likod ng kamay ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako naniniwala sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I-claim ang inosente lahat ng gusto mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi ito magiging madali sa lahat\Nmatibay na ebidensya na mayroon tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagdating ng malinis ay magbibigay sa iyo ng mas magaang pangungusap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba dapat ikaw mismo ang nakakaalam bilang abogado?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hyun-woo, kung sakaling mangyari ulit ito,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}huwag mo akong iligtas.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Noong nagkaroon siya ng relasyon at gusto kang hiwalayan,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}sinubukan mong kitilin ang sarili mong buhay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hyun-woo\NHae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Makalipas ang Isang Buwan{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- Hae-in!\N- Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ito, Nay. kinikilala mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. kamusta ka na?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Magaling ka na ba ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, dapat naging magaspang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.98,0:08:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ina. Tita.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Soo-cheol, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marami na akong narinig tungkol sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat tayong kumain minsan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,medyo pagod sa paglipad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat na siyang umuwi at magpahinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang karapatang makisali.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please mind your manners in front of Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in.\N- Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba kung ano ang ginawa niya sa pamilya natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ipapahayag nila na sinipa ko sila\Nout at kinuha ang Queens,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}ngunit narito ang katotohanan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nasakitan ang chairman sa pag-aaway ng kanyang\Npamilya dahil sa kanyang pera,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}at ibinigay sa akin ang kanyang posisyon bago siya pumanaw.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hiniling din niya sa aking ina na kunin ang kanyang mga asset.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.47,0:09:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gusto niyang mamana mo ang lahat,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pero alam niyang hindi iyon papayagan ng pamilya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang iyong mga tinatawag na miyembro ng pamilya...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}ay natuwa nang marinig na malapit ka nang mamatay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.75,0:09:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon akong magaspang na ideya.\NI nagbasa rin ng maraming artikulo ng balita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala ako na hindi pa tayo\Nkalapit para maging ganito kasaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa pagkikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nakipag-ugnayan ba sa akin ang aking pamilya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:09:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Oo, at iisa lang ang pinag-usapan nila.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gusto nila ang iyong karapatan sa pagboto\Npara sa pagpupulong ng mga stockholder.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nag-aalala sila dahil gusto kitang ibalik.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.47,0:10:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gusto ka nilang kausapin, pero tumanggi ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hiniling mo sa akin na gawin iyon bago ang operasyon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang pagpunta ko ritong mag-isa para sa\Npalabas na major surgery na ito...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}anong uri ng relasyon namin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dapat nabuhay ako...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}isang malungkot na buhay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nagawa mo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Palagi kang nag-iisa,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pero ganoon din sa akin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kaya ang mayroon kami ay isa't isa.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.75,0:10:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huwag magtiwala sa iyong pamilya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ayokong pagsamantalahan ka nila...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.59,0:10:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}anyre.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mali ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung ano ang sinabi niya sa iyo,\Npero huwag kang magtiwala sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Magtiwala sa iyong pamilya sa halip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig kong dinala mo ang\Na anting-anting sa iyong pitaka,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.69,0:10:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,sana mapahina nito ang aking lakas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sinabi mo sa kanya?\N- Nagsasabi ako ng katotohanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Binigay sa akin ni Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.20,0:11:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon mahalaga sa ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in...\N- Narinig ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,isinampa mo ako para sa\Ndepartment store sa Gwanggyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos ibinaba ko kaagad ang demanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kita sinusubukang harapin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana lang hindi mo isipin ang bad blood natin...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,maaaring mabura dahil lang nawalan ako ng memorya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in. Totoo na may problema ang pamilya namin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit maaari naming ipaliwanag ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, at wala siya dapat dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.35,0:11:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat nandito na lang ang asawa mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Ibig mo bang sabihin ang aking dating asawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang lihim na naghanda ng\Ndivorce paper bago ko nalaman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo yan, pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinaparinig mo siyang napakasama,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,pero mahabang kwento.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabalitaan kong nakulong siya dahil sa pagpatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Wala kang pupuntahan, di ba?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kailangan nandito ka kapag binuksan ko ang aking mga mata.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.11,0:12:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bakit mo gustong umuwi?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakuha na ako ng lugar kung saan ka matutuluyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong bumalik sa bahay\Nand mamuhay sa paraang dati.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka matulungan akong mabawi ang aking memorya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong gawin iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ako na baka maunahan ka ng iyong pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakahirap ng iyong mga magulang na maibalik ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Patuloy na sinasabi ng mga direktor\Npaano ka walang kakayahan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.01,0:12:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- dahil sa kalagayan mo.\N- Alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisiguraduhin kong hindi mangyayari iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa iyong pag-aalala.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapat na ang pasasalamat mo sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuparin mo ang iyong pangako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo magpapakasal tayo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,pagkatapos ng operasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipaubaya sa akin ang paghahanda sa kasal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kanina pa.\N- May tanong ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,May nabanggang sasakyan bago ang operasyon ni Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nasa likod mo ba ito?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya namatay, pero,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so ano ang isyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.28,0:13:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang hitsura na iyon? Alam mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Binalaan ko na kayo na...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,maaari siyang masaktan ulit kung dumikit ka sa kanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,at hindi ito magbabago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos ka na bang takutin ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos turn ko na.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang kwarto, hindi ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung saan bumagsak si Chairman Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko ang ginawa mo sa painting na iyon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Niregaluhan ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon akong ebidensya,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya pindutin ulit si Hae-in,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.65,0:14:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,at ilalagay kita sa likod\Nbars gaya ng ginawa ko kay Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How... dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang balakid mo ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Alisin mo ako kung maglakas-loob ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung sabihin niyang pakakasalan niya si Eun-sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi pwede.\N- Kitang-kita ko na darating iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.61,0:14:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,paghusga sa nakita ko ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibang tao siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi niya gagawin iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, binabantayan ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Gil-dong's Detective Agency?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, si Gil-dong ang ninuno ng aming pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinawag din ako ng mga tao na "one of a kind..."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,at pinuri ang aking maraming talento,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.66,0:15:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya iningatan ko ang pangalang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Magbawas ng $10 milyon at\Ngibigay ng $1.5 milyon kay Mr. Kim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring manatili ang gusali.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Binili ko dahil sa boredom.\N- Okay lang. Isa rin siyang detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.84,0:15:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang pagkukunwari sa sarili ko ang pangalawang kalikasan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Nam, lumabas ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Staking out is my second nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sila ang aking kanan at kaliwang kamay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ordinaryo ang hitsura nila, gaya ng nakikita mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,para makapasok sila kahit saan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Detective Hong ang utak ng ating ahensya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay palaging bookworm at dati ay may...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.98,0:15:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,isang negosyong nauugnay sa libro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong uri ng negosyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpatakbo ako ng comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang mga komiks na libro ay ang ultimate\Ndatabase na naglalaman ng...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,lahat ng uri ng case.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sila ang pundasyon ng aking trabaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aling mga kaso ang naimbestigahan mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anumang mga sikat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.75,0:16:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ay para malaman mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang karampatang detective\Nay hindi magtatanong ng ganyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, magkano sa\Nexpenses ang ibinabalik mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask the trivial questions.\NMagkano ang food compensation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Siningil kami ng $8 kada pagkain, pero medyo masikip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang seafood {\i1}jajangmyeon{\i0} ay nagkakahalaga ng\N$12 sa aming kapitbahayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.43,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Nakakabaliw ang mga presyo ngayon, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.27,0:16:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat tayong tumuon sa\Neconomy kaysa sa suspek.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tikom ang bibig niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tikom ang labi. Isulat mo yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ay naku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nandito ka na.\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Magandang trabaho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinundan nila si Hae-in sa\NGermany at pinapanatili akong updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang aming Hong Gil-dong's Detective Agency\Nay palaging magbibigay sa iyo ng diskwento.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Binabantayan namin ang aming target,\Suriin ang dahilan at ang kanilang sikolohiya,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,nag-aalok ng solusyon, at binibigyan ka pa ng warranty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Inaalok namin ang buong package\Nas sinusunod namin ang aming target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:16:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ay naku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi masama, kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kaya sabihin mo sa akin.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano ang nalaman mo?\N- Sasabihin namin sa iyo ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mawawala ka sa lahat ng iyong alalahanin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ito walang laman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa magkaibang kwarto kami natulog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:17:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.31,0:18:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkapareho kami ng taste sa musika.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.69,0:18:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, posible iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong klaseng tao siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako matatalo kung kilala ko ang aking kaaway at ang aking sarili,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi ko kilala ang sarili ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ganoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi ko ba dapat kilalanin ang kaaway ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang pinakaligtas na lugar para makita siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano siya kasungit,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,na nandito siya matapos i-stalk ang dating asawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,sino siya niloko, at pumatay ng tao?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Malamang naging masamang judge ako ng pagkatao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.03,0:19:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako mahuhulog sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maupo ka, Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Malusog ka ba ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi, bakit ako nandito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Naging maayos ba ang operasyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakakuha ka pa ba ng\Ntreatment? Nasasaktan ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ka ba sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Labis akong nag-aalala.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.83,0:20:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala mo tanga ako\Nmula ng nawala ang memorya ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-miss din kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko kung bakit mo ako pinakasalan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,kung paano ka naghanda para sa diborsiyo,\Nat kung ano ang ginawa mo pagkatapos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.43,0:21:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig at nakumpirma ko lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.77,0:21:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung ano ang sinabi sa iyo ni Eun-sung,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit wala sa mga ito ang totoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong nalilito ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.53,0:21:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,pero kung may tiwala ka sa akin...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala lang ako sa nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang divorce papers na inihanda mo sa likod ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang katotohanang ikaw ay nasa\Ndito bilang suspek sa pagpatay,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.79,0:21:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,ang aking nakumpirma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.79,0:21:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon bakit ka pumunta dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung kinumpirma at alam mo ang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.50,0:21:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,bakit ka nandito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba dahil nagdududa ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako dito...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.14,0:21:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin na lang natin...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:22:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya hindi na tayo magkita.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-curious ako, sa totoo lang,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.57,0:22:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ngayong nagkita na tayo,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.65,0:22:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi na tayo magkikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.45,0:22:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkikita tayong muli,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil hindi ako susuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mananatili ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayaman yan, galing sa\Nisang taong nakakulong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nangako ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.73,0:22:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,para makasama ka paggising mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.86,0:22:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na wala ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,, kailangan mong pumunta dito,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.91,0:22:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalabas ako, kahit anong mangyari.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:22:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipinapangako ko sa iyo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.62,0:23:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ikaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate 9971.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.96,0:23:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Naubos na ang oras mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain ng mabuti, huwag mag-alala tungkol sa anumang bagay,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.55,0:23:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,at magpatuloy sa pagpapagamot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.57,0:23:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Inmate 9971.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.59,0:23:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling malusog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.18,0:23:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Paki-gawin iyon para sa akin. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Korea Correctional Service{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.17,0:23:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Muntik na akong sumagot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakatuso niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.55,0:23:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano siya mapanlinlang, kahit bilang isang preso?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.55,0:23:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan ko kung paano niya ako niloko noong nakaraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.85,0:23:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado siyang mahusay magsalita.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko ng gamot para sa pagduduwal. Ang puso ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.49,0:24:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,ay karera.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasusuka ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.99,0:24:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang minuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.79,0:24:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahihilo na ako, gusto kong umiyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.01,0:24:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.98,0:24:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ka nanggaling?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.65,0:24:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nandito?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.61,0:24:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sagutin mo muna ako. saan ka napunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.20,0:24:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayokong sumagot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pwede ka bang umalis?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.99,0:25:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayokong may naririto\N walang pahintulot ko, kahit na ikaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.62,0:25:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.66,0:25:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.66,0:25:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,pero tumatanggap ka pa rin ng\Ntreatment, at sinabi ko sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.33,0:25:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa panganib ka nang maraming beses.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.96,0:25:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,at nasa likod nila si Hyun-woo,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.22,0:25:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nakakulong siya, kaya hindi ako ligtas?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.06,0:25:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,balisa kapag wala ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.85,0:25:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil patuloy na nangyayari ang mga bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.61,0:25:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na sa pag-aalala sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.28,0:25:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.79,0:25:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpahinga ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.46,0:26:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pwede. Totoo nga yata ang mga tsismis\Natungkol sa kanilang kasal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos na ba kay Direk Baek?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.84,0:26:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Panoorin kung ano ang iyong sasabihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.05,0:26:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat tayo ay pumirma sa NDA,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.01,0:26:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- lalo na ikaw.\N- Ano ang dapat ipag-alala?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.60,0:26:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi na ako nagtatrabaho para sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.52,0:26:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi tayo magkikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.86,0:26:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.36,0:26:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.61,0:26:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig ko ang tungkol sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.40,0:26:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Magaling ka na ba ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.43,0:27:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.45,0:27:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagaan talaga ako ng loob. talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa iyong pagbabayad para sa\Noperasyon at bayarin sa ospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.70,0:27:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho-rong...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.79,0:27:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,May totoong pangalan na siya ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.54,0:27:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So-yul.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Malusog na si So-yul ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.00,0:27:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutuwa ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.21,0:27:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming salamat. Hinding-hindi ko ito makakalimutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.18,0:27:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ginawa ko ba yun?\N- Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginawa ko ba talaga yung sinabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.81,0:27:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako sigurado. Bago pa ako matanggap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.73,0:27:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa pagtupad sa iyong pangako.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.82,0:27:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Pangako? Anong pangako?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.78,0:27:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nangako kang babalik bago ko matapos\Nbayaran ang mga installment para dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.37,0:27:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So ikaw ang naging secretary ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.83,0:27:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.96,0:27:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon dapat marami kang alam tungkol sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.62,0:27:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre. Isaalang-alang ako na isang\Nhuman external hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.88,0:27:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ganoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.46,0:28:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,anong klaseng tao ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.09,0:28:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.89,0:28:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.14,0:28:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong, natuwa ako sa narinig...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.10,0:28:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,bumalik ka. Okay ka na ba ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.06,0:28:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay isang empleyado na kilala mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.86,0:28:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa iyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.44,0:28:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,natanggap ng aking ina ang lahat ng kanyang\Npaggamot at pumanaw nang payapa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.15,0:28:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpadala ka ng bulaklak sa kanya\Nfuneral, sinagot ang gastos,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.86,0:28:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,at dumaan pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.28,0:28:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring hindi mo matandaan, ngunit lagi kong maaalala.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.83,0:28:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.79,0:28:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.59,0:28:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpadala ako ng mga bulaklak sa libing ng miyembro ng aking empleyado\Nkapamilya?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.88,0:28:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano ako kasensitibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.97,0:28:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Si Direk Baek yun...\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.68,0:28:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ay isang mabuting tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.43,0:28:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Panahon na nating putulin ang lahat ng brand...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.31,0:28:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}na humahadlang sa aming mga benta.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.31,0:28:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mainit ang puso mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Malikhain ba ito? Aling bahagi? Paano?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.45,0:29:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nacurious lang ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.99,0:29:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sagutin mo ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.07,0:29:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Aling bahagi? Paano? Bakit?!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.49,0:29:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mabait ka rin.\N- Ganun ba talaga ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay Teresa?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, hulaan ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.58,0:29:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.42,0:29:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,May nakita akong pusang gala dito,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.50,0:29:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,at gusto kong pakainin ito ng meryenda,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.26,0:29:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya bumili ako at pinakain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.84,0:29:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Parang desperado na akong gumawa ng mabuti.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.72,0:29:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring nawalan ako ng memorya,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nananatili pa rin ang tunay kong pagkatao.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.77,0:29:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana magkaayos tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.77,0:29:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- Ikaw ang external hard drive ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Para akong motherboard na\Nundergone sa factory reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.74,0:29:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko ang aking external hard\Ndrive na naglalaman ng aking data.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.95,0:29:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero nasa ibang department ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.70,0:29:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako na ang bahala.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.29,0:30:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan ang rekord ng ebidensya ng prosekusyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano? Bakit?\N- Isa itong kasong murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.13,0:30:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto nilang mangalap ng maraming ebidensya hangga't maaari.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.37,0:30:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung may anumang bagay na hindi nila naisumite bilang ebidensya,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.38,0:30:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,dapat ito ay pabor sa atin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.10,0:30:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ang ebidensya na hindi nila isinumite...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.23,0:30:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,ito ba ang component analysis ng\Ntrace evidence sa pinangyarihan ng krimen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.21,0:30:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, isang piraso ng berdeng hibla.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.15,0:30:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kaya't hindi kay Hyun-woo.\N- Kaya naman tinanggal nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.57,0:30:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ay galing ito sa damit ng tunay na pumatay,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.15,0:30:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,at kailangan natin silang hanapin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.82,0:30:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ang patalim na ginamit bilang sandata ng pagpatay...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.70,0:30:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,akin talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So bakit nandoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.25,0:30:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baka ninakaw.\N- Naniniwala ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,nawala ito ng ilang araw\Nbago kami umalis papuntang Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.51,0:30:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi ko masyadong inisip iyon.\N- Kaya ito ay ninakaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.98,0:30:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Titingnan ko ang mga CCTV camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.40,0:30:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa pa. Pakitingnan ang mga dashcam ng bus...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.42,0:30:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,na umaandar malapit sa pinangyarihan\Nasa paligid ng oras ng pagpatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.13,0:30:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka may kahina-hinalang sasakyan,\Ni ang pumatay ay nakasakay sa bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.72,0:30:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta. Gaano kadalas ito matatanggal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:31:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, may itatanong ako sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.73,0:31:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,May mga camera ba malapit sa lugar ng pangingisda?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatay, inalis ko silang lahat sa bubong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.35,0:31:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Alisin ang ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.41,0:31:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang mga uwak ay umiiyak buong araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.87,0:31:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Natutuwa akong ginawa mo iyan bago ang pagdinig ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.46,0:31:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig kong sabihin...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong magiging maayos ang pagdinig.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.54,0:31:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.55,0:31:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi pabor ang mga uwak.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.01,0:31:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, kumain ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.17,0:31:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.97,0:31:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi ang laver.\N- Bakit hindi?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.14,0:31:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibabalot mo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.89,0:31:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bawal kayong lahat sa\Npagbabalot, pag-dunking, o paghahalo...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.48,0:31:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,anumang pagkain ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.56,0:31:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag ka ring mag-drop ng kahit ano.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.11,0:31:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Masama ang pakiramdam...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.61,0:31:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,kung ginawa mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.65,0:31:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Magandang umaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.03,0:31:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, ang lamig.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.49,0:31:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagod na si Da-hye at gustong matulog.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.54,0:32:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi iyon binibilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.09,0:32:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi sila nahulog.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.13,0:32:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Inilagay lang sila ni Soo-cheol...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.42,0:32:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,sa sahig...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.97,0:32:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,tulad nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.01,0:32:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama siya. Inilagay mo sila...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.72,0:32:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,sa sahig, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.48,0:32:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, binitawan ko sila,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.52,0:32:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit ako ay medyo magaan at walang pakialam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.85,0:32:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibabalot ko ito sa ilang laver,\Ndunk it sa sopas...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.36,0:32:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Masarap talaga ang sabaw na ito ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.82,0:32:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang nasasakdal ay malapit sa krimen\Nscene sa tinatayang oras...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.83,0:32:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,ng pagkamatay ng biktima sa pagitan ng 8 at 9 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.29,0:32:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,, Dagdag pa, ang buhok ng nasasakdal\N ay natagpuan sa kotse ng biktima.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.79,0:32:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dugo ng biktima at mga fingerprint ng\Ndefendant...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,ay natagpuan din sa sandata ng pagpatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.88,0:32:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Samakatuwid, gusto naming\Nkasuhan si Baek Hyun-woo para sa pagpatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.01,0:32:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Aminin mo ba ang pagsingil na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.47,0:32:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.47,0:33:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo na pumayag akong\Nkilalanin ang biktima noong araw na iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.68,0:33:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi siya nagpakita.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.27,0:33:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya hindi ko siya nakita.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.94,0:33:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang depensa ay maaaring gumawa ng kanilang argumento.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.48,0:33:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.65,0:33:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Inangkin ng kliyente ko ang pagiging inosente...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,mula pa sa simula ng pagsisiyasat na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.15,0:33:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung totoo, nandiyan ang tunay na pumatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.37,0:33:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan natin ang pagpatay\Nweapon the prosecution claims...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.45,0:33:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,upang maging kanilang pinaka mapagpasyang ebidensya.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.16,0:33:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,May mga bakas ang kutsilyo sa kusina...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.79,0:33:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,ng mga kopya ng nasasakdal, dugo ng biktima,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.88,0:33:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,pati na rin ang isang piraso ng berdeng acrylic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.05,0:33:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,, Gaya ng nakikita mo, ang\Ndefendant ay walang suot na berde.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit na, hindi niyan mapapatunayan na pag-aari ng iba si Nit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.09,0:33:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumasang-ayon ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.51,0:33:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, paano kung may nakasuot ng berde...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.39,0:33:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,ninakaw ang kutsilyo sa kanyang tahanan...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.23,0:33:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,na natagpuan malapit sa pinangyarihan ng krimen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay kutsilyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.37,0:34:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.67,0:34:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang kutsilyong ginamit sa pagpatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.42,0:34:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagkataon na nakasuot din siya ng berde.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.26,0:34:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Susunod na footage, pakiusap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.97,0:34:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ang parehong indibidwal ay nakikitang nasusunog...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.64,0:34:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,kanyang T-shirt, guwantes, at iba pang\Ndamit na mahigit isang milya lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.43,0:34:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,mula sa pinangyarihan ng krimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.02,0:34:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Humiling ako ng pagsusuri ng\Nnasunog na hibla at ang...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,matatagpuan sa sandata ng pagpatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.27,0:34:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang infrared spectrophotometer ay nagpakita...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.36,0:34:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...na ang mga hibla na ito ay magkapareho,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.98,0:34:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,at nakita sa T-shirt ang dugo ng biktima at\NDNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.82,0:34:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay lahat ng circumstantial evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.78,0:34:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang sandata ng pagpatay ay may\Nbakas lamang ng mga kopya ng nasasakdal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung mayroon akong mas tiyak na patunay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.08,0:34:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Halimbawa, mga larawan at\Nvideo ng pinangyarihan ng krimen...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.36,0:34:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,, kinuha ng killer ang kanyang sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.83,0:34:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dapat ay kumuha siya ng mga larawan o video.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.42,0:34:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kailangan natin ang kanyang telepono.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.80,0:34:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang ibig mo bang sabihin ay nagtala siya ng sarili niyang krimen?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.26,0:35:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Oo, kung siya ay isang hitman.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.05,0:35:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kailangan niya ng patunay para mabayaran.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.80,0:35:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kailangan niyang mag-click sa URL na ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.68,0:35:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ihahatid ang iyong item sa 2 p.m.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kinokopya...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.35,0:35:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ginawa niya. Maaari ko nang i-duplicate ang kanyang telepono!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.19,0:35:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang hindi kilalang indibidwal...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.94,0:35:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,pinadalhan ako ng mga larawan at video...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.18,0:35:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,ng pinangyarihan ng krimen na\Nnasa telepono ng pumatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.65,0:35:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isusumite ko ito bilang ebidensya.\N- Pagtutol.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.61,0:35:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami sumang-ayon sa ebidensyang ito noon pa man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring nakuha ito\Nillegal. Paki-dismiss ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.08,0:35:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Itong mapagpasyang ebidensya\Nay lubos na makakaapekto sa paglilitis!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.76,0:35:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Bench{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatanggapin ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.45,0:36:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ang tunay na pumatay sa Yeongjin-gun\NSambang Reservoir Murder...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.17,0:36:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}ay naaresto.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.25,0:36:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Inaresto ng Busan Coast Guard si Yoo,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.42,0:36:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}na sumusubok na\Ngalaw sa isang bangkang pangisda...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.75,0:36:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}alas-11 kagabi mga 9 nautical miles sa timog.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.50,0:36:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sinabi ni Yoo na ginawa niya\Nang krimen nang mag-isa.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.38,0:36:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Samantala, si Baek, na\Narrested bilang suspek,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.26,0:36:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}ay napawalang-sala sa unang pagdinig ngayong araw.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.89,0:36:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kaagad siyang pinalaya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.93,0:36:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi siya lumalabas?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,May nangyari ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.23,0:36:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lalabas siya kapag oras na.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.15,0:36:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit tayo nandito?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.65,0:36:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I should be on my toes,\Nsince delikado akong stalker...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.86,0:36:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- pinalaya na.\N- Hindi siya nag-stalk...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.95,0:36:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, mas parang stalker ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.83,0:36:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi ako...\N- Ayan na siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.88,0:36:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Narito!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.96,0:36:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe kong kapatid!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.68,0:37:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makapaniwala dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.80,0:37:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.55,0:37:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.64,0:37:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Malamang nag-aalala ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.85,0:37:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess everyone has their\Nset dami ng problema sa buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.56,0:37:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kami ni Hyeon-tae ay palaging nagdulot ng mga walang kuwentang problema,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.98,0:37:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi kailanman ganito kalaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.48,0:37:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang nagawa si Hyun-woo. Na-frame siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.07,0:37:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.78,0:37:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- Ligtas ka na ngayon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.91,0:37:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.58,0:37:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Close yata sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.34,0:37:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Isang magiliw na pamilya."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.76,0:37:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kainin mo ito.\N- Hindi, salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.76,0:37:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.68,0:37:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi yata siya kumakain ng tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hindi kumakain ng tokwa."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.56,0:37:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayaw niya ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bakit? Ang sarap.\N- Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.57,0:38:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.12,0:38:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita niya ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.62,0:38:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ginawa niya, di ba?\N- Umalis siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.13,0:38:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.01,0:38:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda. Lihim nating sundan sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.97,0:38:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Seryoso ba tayong ini-stalk sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.10,0:38:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre hindi. gusto ko lang...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.77,0:38:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,upang bantayan siya at\Ntingnan kung may iba pa siyang balak.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.31,0:38:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang stalking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.44,0:38:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige lang, na.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.95,0:38:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiyaking naka-level ito nang maayos.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.66,0:38:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginagawa ko na ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.50,0:38:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumaba ka kung natatakot ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.83,0:39:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan kong suriin, bagaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.04,0:39:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Du-gwan, magiging okay ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.63,0:39:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre. Kung magagawa ko, ibibigay ko ang lahat nang libre.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.22,0:39:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Hyun-woo Discharged\NHalf Price Sale!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.84,0:39:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo rin bang bilhin iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.10,0:39:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, dapat gusto mo ang {\i1}mandu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.10,0:39:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa bahay ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.02,0:39:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit, salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.98,0:39:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mas nagpapasalamat ako.\N- Congratulations din.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.40,0:39:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.36,0:39:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.78,0:39:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.15,0:39:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakuha mo na ba sa wakas ang aking pilosopiya sa marketing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.99,0:39:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganap. Dapat akong humingi ng pagmamahal sa aking mga customer,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.85,0:39:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi pera.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.91,0:39:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,, Eksakto.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.97,0:39:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinusunod ko ang pilosopiyang iyon kapag bumalik ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.08,0:39:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.12,0:39:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.83,0:39:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, kalahati din ba ang mga steamed bun na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.09,0:39:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Steamed buns? Hoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Half off, paa ko!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.88,0:39:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Itabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.93,0:39:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Libre sila. Patumbahin ang iyong sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.72,0:39:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Libre rin ang ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.81,0:40:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba siya magsisisi bukas?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.31,0:40:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bukas? Pagsisisihan niya ito ngayong gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.48,0:40:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, pumila ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.73,0:40:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Hyun-woo dapat iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.44,0:40:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness! Hoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.07,0:40:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.95,0:40:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodness!\N- Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.91,0:40:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.96,0:40:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakauwi na ako, Ama.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.63,0:40:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.00,0:40:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wag mong sabihin yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.01,0:40:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka hihingi ng tawad\Nkapag wala kang ginawang mali?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.39,0:40:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Magaling, Hyun-woo.\N- Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.56,0:40:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Magaling ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.72,0:40:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations.\N- Magaling.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.56,0:40:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahirap siguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.81,0:40:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.19,0:40:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maligayang pagbabalik, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.57,0:40:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Soo-cheol yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.74,0:40:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, nag-stay siya dito\Nand iniiwasan ang kanyang ina.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.99,0:40:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero bakit dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.87,0:41:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay tahanan ng mga magulang ng dating asawa ng kanyang kapatid na babae.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.21,0:41:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumportable ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.17,0:41:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo kung gaano sila kasaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.42,0:41:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakaibang pamilya sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.51,0:41:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Umuulan ng niyebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.68,0:41:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh!\N- Gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.57,0:41:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.70,0:41:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.08,0:41:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.08,0:41:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumawa ako ng matamis na sinigang na red-bean, paborito mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.13,0:41:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Malamang nag-alala ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.92,0:41:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uy, hindi ako nag-alala...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.72,0:41:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,isang bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.84,0:41:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil laging mananaig ang hustisya.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.05,0:42:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.35,0:42:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala akong may sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.27,0:42:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ako din.\N- Ako din.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.85,0:42:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaraming pinagdaanan ng kawawang baby ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.19,0:42:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala akong may sakit!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.49,0:42:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang mabait ang mga magulang niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.91,0:42:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat hindi niya gusto ang tofu, pero\Nenjoy ang matamis na sinigang na red-bean.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.33,0:42:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bata ba siya, o ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.79,0:42:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Masarap kumain..."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.71,0:42:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"sweet red-bean sinigang."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.34,0:42:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinaalala mo sa akin ang aking sarili sa nakaraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.92,0:42:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.92,0:42:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you before I fell in love with BTS.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.18,0:42:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang tunay na pag-ibig ay hindi,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.30,0:42:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sus, mahal na mahal ko siya."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.22,0:42:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay, "Ano ito? Anong deal niya?"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.31,0:42:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganyan magsisimula.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.52,0:42:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagi mo bang sinasabi ang iyong isip sa harap ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.86,0:42:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.53,0:42:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a laid-back boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:43:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang maalala?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.20,0:43:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.20,0:43:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,natatandaan mo bang pumayag kang bigyan ako ng $100,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.75,0:43:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang paraan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.79,0:43:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring hindi mo matandaan, ngunit\Mayroon ka pa ring malinaw na paghatol,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.29,0:43:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so bakit hindi mo alam?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.63,0:43:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kung ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.80,0:43:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang tunay mong mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.72,0:43:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At sino iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.76,0:43:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko masabi, dahil nasa linya ang trabaho ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.06,0:43:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,pero sasabihin ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.06,0:43:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang iyong puso ay namamalagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.98,0:43:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,kung saan napupunta ang iyong katawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.06,0:44:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.35,0:44:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Natagpuan ito ni Ivan sa basurahan at\Nsabi na dapat nating hanapin ang may-ari nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.56,0:44:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,May pangalan ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.77,0:44:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, at hindi ko ito mabasa dahil\Nit ay nasa banyagang wika.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.20,0:44:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon paano natin mahahanap ang may-ari nito?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.61,0:44:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Itapon mo lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.07,0:44:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka notebook yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.28,0:44:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Attorney ni Baek...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.74,0:44:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,tumawag mula sa Korea at hiniling kay\Nus na ibalik ang isang notebook sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.29,0:44:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pupunta na ako.\N- Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.34,0:44:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-song.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.34,0:44:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumalik na naman siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.49,0:45:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tita Beom-ja, dito ka ba nakatira o ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.70,0:45:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nandito ako para batiin si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.54,0:45:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Malapit nang dumating ang catering service.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.54,0:45:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihan ko ba sila na pumunta sa community hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.61,0:45:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta, Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.05,0:45:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. Nandito ka rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.47,0:45:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghanda din ako ng maraming regalo,\Ndahil maganda ang mood ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.39,0:45:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Punta ka mamaya.\N- Sus, mga regalo?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.89,0:45:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulad ng...?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.06,0:45:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Supplements at massagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.39,0:45:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang grand prize ay ang pinakabagong front load washer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.84,0:45:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, isang washer?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.85,0:45:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi pwede.\N- Isang washer?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.65,0:45:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, nagpaplano kaming kumuha ng bago.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.23,0:45:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganito ba ibinabaluktot ng mayayaman ang kanilang pera?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.49,0:45:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong mamuhay tulad niya sa susunod kong buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.45,0:45:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulad ko? At ano yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.49,0:45:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,May pera ka. ang ganda mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.41,0:45:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,at higit sa lahat, tatlong beses kang nagpakasal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.41,0:45:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang pinaka inggit niyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.08,0:45:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo na kailangang banggitin iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.94,0:45:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.96,0:46:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi lahat ay kayang gawin iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.59,0:46:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, sumasang-ayon ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.59,0:46:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko na mapapalitan ang washer ko, pati asawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.72,0:46:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wag mong sabihin yan sa harap ng bachelor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.05,0:46:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, hindi ka ba talaga magpapakasal?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.99,0:46:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can vouch for that kindergarten teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.93,0:46:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama si Bang-sil. She really\Njumped through hoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.39,0:46:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilalanin lang ang babaeng iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.90,0:46:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo siya dapat hayaan...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.96,0:46:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,magpasya para sa kanyang sarili.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.23,0:46:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mo siyang hikayatin.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.61,0:46:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong magpatuloy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.82,0:46:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano sa susunod na linggo?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.86,0:46:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeong-song...\N- Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.70,0:46:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan na naman ang community hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.32,0:46:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Lucky Draws{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.07,0:46:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Ipagdiwang ang Paglabas ni Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.25,0:46:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Palakpakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.50,0:46:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lahat! Gusto kong magpasalamat sa inyong lahat...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.00,0:46:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa pagdalo sa pagdiriwang ng aking kapatid...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.47,0:46:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Paglabas ni Baek Hyun-woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.47,0:46:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Narito ang highlight ng party.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.02,0:46:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Puputulin niya ang tokwa. Palakpakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.52,0:47:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabay-sabay nating gawin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.94,0:47:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Isa, dalawa, tatlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.07,0:47:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ay isang malinis na hiwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.95,0:47:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations.\N- Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.91,0:47:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakuha ko!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.28,0:47:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanalo ako ng TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.45,0:47:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang susunod na premyo ay supplements.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.21,0:47:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kapatid kong babae, Ms. Baek Mi-seon,\Npipili ang mananalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.67,0:47:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lumabas ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.26,0:47:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumili ng isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.89,0:47:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang masuwerteng numero ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.98,0:47:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,17!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.94,0:47:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.32,0:47:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Si Bang-sil!\N- Ako ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.99,0:47:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.82,0:47:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bang-sil!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.33,0:47:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Binabati kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.49,0:48:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat, Hyun-woo. Magiging mas maganda pa ako ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.75,0:48:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Binabati kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.75,0:48:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ang pinakahihintay na grand prize...\N- I'm fated to never go gutom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.67,0:48:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...ang washer, ang natitira na lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.76,0:48:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Si Hong Beom-ja, na naghanda ng lahat ng mga regalong ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.34,0:48:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,ay iaanunsyo ang nanalo. Palakpakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.70,0:48:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang nanalo ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.12,0:48:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lima! Binabati kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.41,0:48:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.88,0:48:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Sus, Yeong-song ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-song, nanalo ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.17,0:48:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-song ito!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.66,0:48:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-song!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.68,0:48:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyo na!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.09,0:48:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanalo ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.51,0:48:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:48:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.68,0:49:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Talaga?\N- Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.18,0:49:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kailangan, pero kailangan niyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.77,0:49:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Seryoso?\N- Hindi pwede!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.16,0:49:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.54,0:49:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Community Hall{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.92,0:49:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Teka, Mr. Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.51,0:49:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, Beom-ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.51,0:49:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ka na hindi makasarili?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.47,0:49:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanalo ka ng washer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.12,0:49:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyo na.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.18,0:49:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero gumagana nang maayos ang washer ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.81,0:49:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong napakatanda na nito at hindi matatag. nakita ko na.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.23,0:49:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginagawa pa rin nito ang trabaho nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.94,0:49:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang pinakabagong modelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.94,0:49:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay may AI system. Maaari itong maglaba ng mga kumot at sapatos.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.63,0:49:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.65,0:49:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oo"?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.36,0:49:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat mong kunin ang mga pagkakataon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.83,0:50:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayundin sa mga washer at tao.\NBakit hindi mo sila hawakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.67,0:50:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi na ako babalik dito kapag umalis ako ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.88,0:50:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo pa rin ako hahawakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.92,0:50:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kung hindi mo na ako makikita?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.01,0:50:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang pumipigil sa akin na magpakasal muli?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.76,0:50:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikakasal ka na ba ulit?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.89,0:50:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon ang ibig kong sabihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.90,0:50:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ko ito minsan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.65,0:50:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesado ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.15,0:50:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.49,0:50:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kita,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.99,0:50:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,so wala ka bang gagawin tungkol dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.37,0:50:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag umalis ako, hindi na ako babalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.30,0:50:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.50,0:50:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang minuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.71,0:50:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,May itatanong ako sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.99,0:50:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Papasok na ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.01,0:51:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi iyon ang dahilan.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.80,0:51:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano yun?\N- Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.60,0:51:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.72,0:51:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang bagay na ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.23,0:51:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay wireless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.64,0:51:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay konektado sa mga panloob na speaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.52,0:51:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gayundin sa mga washer at tao.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.57,0:51:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bakit hindi mo sila hawakan?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.03,0:51:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi na ako babalik dito...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.65,0:51:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kapag umalis ako ngayon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.03,0:51:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi mo pa rin ako hinahawakan?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.72,0:51:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Paano kung hindi mo na ako makikita?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.14,0:51:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ano ang pumipigil sa akin na magpakasal muli?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.17,0:51:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.18,0:51:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sobrang cool niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.50,0:51:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.83,0:51:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ikakasal ka na ba?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.36,0:51:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gago ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.38,0:51:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon ang ibig niyang sabihin.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.75,0:51:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi iyon ang ibig kong sabihin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.22,0:51:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sasabihin ko ito minsan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.76,0:51:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Interesado ako sa iyo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.51,0:51:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.55,0:51:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gusto kita,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.52,0:51:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so wala ka bang gagawin dito?\NOnce umalis ako, hindi na ako babalik.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.27,0:51:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.61,0:51:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakahiya siya sa pamilya namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.62,0:52:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-song! Sagot ng matalino!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.62,0:52:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tita Beom-ja!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.62,0:52:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayos lang!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.66,0:52:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ayos lang!\N- Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.08,0:52:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ka pupunta? Hindi, teka!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.04,0:52:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, dapat mo siyang ipagpatuloy!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.67,0:52:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ituloy mo!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.26,0:52:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumunod ka sa kanya! Magmadali!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.76,0:52:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-song!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.93,0:52:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, hiniling ni Baek Hyun-woo sa\Npersonnel committee na ibalik siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.10,0:52:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Binaba ang kanyang kasong pagpatay,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.77,0:52:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya walang legal na paraan para tanggihan ang kanyang kahilingan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.79,0:52:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, zombie ba siya o ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.32,0:52:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay isang matiyaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.94,0:52:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka, pero may mas malaking problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.20,0:52:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The limited partners' meeting\Nay magaganap sa New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.74,0:52:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumoto sila hinggil sa\Npagtanggal ng chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.12,0:52:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.37,0:52:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung nabigo ang chairman na magbigay,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.08,0:52:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,o fabricates, ang financial\Ndocuments sa mga investor,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.21,0:53:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,ang mga limitadong partner ay maaaring magdaos ng\Nmeeting at i-dismiss ang chairman...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.15,0:53:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.17,0:53:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang nagbigay ng mga dokumentong iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.60,0:53:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Baek Hyun-woo ba? tama ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.47,0:53:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano sa tingin mo? I'm wearing\Nito para sa aking Chairman inauguration.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.24,0:53:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang inagurasyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.57,0:53:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,May dapat ba akong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.40,0:53:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nababagay ito sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.49,0:53:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.74,0:53:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat mas maaga kong nahanap ang lugar ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.33,0:53:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumawag sa bangko.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.58,0:53:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin sa kanila na doblehin...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.64,0:53:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,ang nakaraang transaksyon at\Ngawin itong 4.2% sa maingat na pagpapasya.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.44,0:53:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabay-sabay?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.46,0:53:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong oras. Kailangan kong\Nbumili ng maraming stock hangga't kaya ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.71,0:53:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,para hindi nila ako ma-kick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.80,0:53:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.59,0:53:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumili siya ng 4.2% nang sabay-sabay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.18,0:53:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat siya ay nagmamadali.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.22,0:53:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre. Sa wakas ay ginagastos na niya ang lihim na pondo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.89,0:53:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahanap na ba natin ang mga file na dapat ibigay ni Mr. Pyeon\N?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.48,0:53:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.90,0:54:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, iba ang natanggap ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.23,0:54:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mapapatunayan nito si Eun-sung at ang kanyang mga tauhan...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.69,0:54:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,nagsagawa ng $2 bilyon na pamumuhunan\Npanloloko upang kunin ang Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.03,0:54:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. Sino ang nagbigay nito sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.46,0:54:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dala mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.97,0:54:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang pera mula sa U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.64,0:54:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ayan.\N- Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.26,0:54:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Halika na.\N- Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.14,0:54:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinigay ko lahat ng pera\NI nakuha kay Seul-hee. yun lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.52,0:54:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,At ang perang ibinigay mo sa pamilyang Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.77,0:54:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa kanila iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.40,0:54:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,At ang USB stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.61,0:54:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Da-hye ang nagbigay nito sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.20,0:54:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.28,0:54:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sinabi ko na sa iyo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.45,0:54:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Linya ng buhay ko yan, kaya tinago ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.20,0:54:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang iyong lifeline?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.04,0:54:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, tanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.37,0:55:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya mamamatay ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.42,0:55:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Sapat na sa iyo si Ms. Moh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.17,0:55:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinambah kita, kaya nagmadali ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.55,0:55:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong alam mong kinasusuklaman niya ang mga kaibig-ibig na babae.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.93,0:55:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling tahimik.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.18,0:55:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.02,0:55:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Buksan mo!\N- Manahimik ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.73,0:55:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yung tanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.76,0:55:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hoy, tupakan mo ang gas.\N- Buksan mo!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.22,0:55:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling tahimik.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.23,0:55:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling tahimik!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.36,0:55:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ihinto ang sasakyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.49,0:55:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling tahimik!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.16,0:55:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ihinto ang sasakyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.20,0:55:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mo na si Da-hye!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.66,0:55:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.17,0:55:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it! Buksan mo ang pinto!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.22,0:55:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.45,0:56:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano bang problema niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.87,0:56:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,High on something ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.29,0:56:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.67,0:56:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirtbag mo!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.88,0:56:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko sayo bitawan mo siya!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.80,0:56:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatiling tahimik.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.30,0:56:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol! Takbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.88,0:56:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang mamatay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.14,0:56:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.39,0:56:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ay, hindi!\N- Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.31,0:56:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.56,0:56:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Umalis ka na habang nagpapakabait pa ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.98,0:56:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.98,0:56:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Itigil ang pagpalo, at tumakbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.36,0:56:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo sinusubukang maging bayani?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.66,0:56:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Takbo!\N- Manahimik ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.88,0:57:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.30,0:57:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.97,0:57:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamatay!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.02,0:57:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamatay!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.40,0:57:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mamatay!\N- Takbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.99,0:57:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Da-hye!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.04,0:57:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Geon-u!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.08,0:57:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Paano kung kailangan kong protektahan\Nang aking pamilya sa hinaharap,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.91,0:57:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pero hindi ko kaya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.75,0:57:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Natatakot ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.96,0:57:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, pare...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.63,0:57:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Palakihin,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.88,0:57:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}para maging mayabang sila at mag-isip,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.18,0:58:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}"Hindi siya kapares sa akin."{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.14,0:58:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}"Medyo nanalo ako."{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.06,0:58:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}"Nakakagulat na malakas ako."{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.77,0:58:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.31,0:58:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Darn it!\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.31,0:58:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.73,0:58:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dapat kang maghintay hanggang sa mawalan sila ng bantay,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.19,0:58:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pagkatapos ay ilagay ang iyong kritikal na suntok.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.04,0:58:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na. Alisin ang bisikleta.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.71,0:58:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alisin...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.25,0:59:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano...?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.37,0:59:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.88,0:59:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.25,0:59:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol, buksan mo ang iyong mga mata.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.00,0:59:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.60,0:59:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulis? Nasa Yongdu-ri railroad kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.23,0:59:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.23,0:59:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumising.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.44,0:59:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.19,0:59:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Patay na ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.15,0:59:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.86,0:59:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.41,0:59:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.62,0:59:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.91,0:59:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahal kita. huwag kang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.66,0:59:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.83,0:59:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.88,0:59:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako rin.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.17,1:00:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.39,1:00:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ginawa iyon?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.48,1:00:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Soo-cheol...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.83,1:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay. Bakit ko siya iniiwasan?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.25,1:00:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang CEO.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.58,1:00:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatuwa.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.00,1:00:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang pinayagan siyang bumalik dito?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.55,1:00:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako dapat ang magtanong.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan kitang makausap.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.32,1:01:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayundin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.62,1:01:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-reinstate ka?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.45,1:01:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.45,1:01:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil ba sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.79,1:01:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang workplace ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.08,1:01:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang pumunta sa ibang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.46,1:01:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pili ko yan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.09,1:01:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako mapalagay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.55,1:01:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako komportable,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.26,1:01:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya mangyaring magbitiw at humanap ng bagong trabaho.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.51,1:01:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayoko talaga...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.51,1:01:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,para makita ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.06,1:01:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang hitsura na iyon?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.52,1:01:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Iniwan mo akong mataas at tuyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.02,1:01:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo kaya mo na akong akitin\N simula nung nawala ako sa memorya ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.65,1:01:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.16,1:01:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo lagi akong ideal type,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.32,1:01:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,at mahuhulog ka ulit sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.74,1:01:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakatitiwala mo,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.75,1:01:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya naisip ko na makikilala mo ako sa lalong madaling panahon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.42,1:01:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.42,1:01:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.63,1:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko itong paparating.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.21,1:02:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas walanghiya ka sa inaakala ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.68,1:02:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,May ipinangako ba sa iyo ang pamilya ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.39,1:02:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nagsisikap?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.58,1:02:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in...\N- Wag mong sabihin ang pangalan ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.22,1:02:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Madali akong nahulog...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.93,1:02:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa iyong titig at boses sa nakaraan,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.56,1:02:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi na.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.73,1:02:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayaw na kitang makitang muli.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.20,1:02:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.45,1:02:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag gawin ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.29,1:02:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi...\N- Ayokong marinig.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.04,1:02:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mo akong hawakan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.38,1:02:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitawan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.76,1:03:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sender Grünwald Medical Center{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.22,1:03:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.73,1:03:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, ako ito. Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.32,1:03:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. Wala ka talagang maalala.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.99,1:03:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang paborito mong tao...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.82,1:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,pinakatiwalaan mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.04,1:04:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.42,1:04:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.13,1:04:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we were close enough\Nto talk casually and hug each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.76,1:04:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.22,1:04:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ako ito.\N- Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.39,1:04:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano niya nalaman?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.31,1:04:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyayari?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.43,1:04:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung napakatumpak ng kanyang mga kutob,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.14,1:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,bakit hinahayaan pa niyang lokohin siya ni Eun-sung?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.58,1:04:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mayroon kang mail{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.91,1:04:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.08,1:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}The Aqua Sender: Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.50,1:04:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa akin ito galing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.33,1:04:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpadala ako ng imbitasyon sa sarili ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.89,1:04:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang pumasok.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.56,1:05:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.73,1:05:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Papasok na siya ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.61,1:05:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit walang laman ang malaking lugar na ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.99,1:05:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nandito?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.40,1:05:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong itanong sa iyo iyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.95,1:06:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpadala ka sa akin ng imbitasyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.60,1:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sisimulan na natin ang kasal...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.01,1:06:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}ng Hong Hae-in, ang nobya,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.77,1:06:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}at Baek Hyun-woo, ang nobyo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.31,1:06:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Narito ang lalaking ikakasal.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.62,1:07:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Well...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.33,1:07:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kumusta ka, Hyun-woo mula sa hinaharap?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.59,1:07:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Huwag mong sabihing nakipagdiborsiyo ka.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.71,1:07:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}May mga anak ka ba?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.59,1:07:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Isa? Dalawa?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.84,1:07:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Gayunpaman, hindi mahalaga,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.18,1:07:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}dahil ang kailangan ko lang ay Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.01,1:07:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Huwag mo siyang iyakan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.10,1:07:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Pasayahin mo siya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.23,1:07:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Minamahal na Hae-in mula sa hinaharap.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.07,1:07:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Duda akong manonood ka, ngunit kung oo,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.65,1:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}bakit ikaw?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.95,1:08:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I-off ito at magtrabaho.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.91,1:08:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi ko na tatanungin kung kumusta ka, dahil alam ko...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.24,1:08:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}magaling ka.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.66,1:08:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Magiging maganda ka, malusog,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.79,1:08:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}at ang pinakamatagumpay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.58,1:08:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kasama si Hyun-woo...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.83,1:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}sa iyo, siyempre.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.10,1:08:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.77,1:08:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.36,1:08:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Pinaupahan ni Hong ang buong\Naquarium at pinadalhan ka ng mga bulaklak na ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.61,1:08:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagrenta ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.24,1:08:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ang aquarium na ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.43,1:08:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailan?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.45,1:08:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mga isang buwan na ang nakalipas,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.45,1:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,at apat na taon din ang nakalipas.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.41,1:08:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.08,1:08:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sabi nila ito ang pinakamagandang dating spot,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.58,1:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pero bakit ito walang laman?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.17,1:08:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ms. Hong, sa mga araw na ito...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.92,1:09:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}parang ang buong uniberso...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.76,1:09:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}ay nasa panig namin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.85,1:09:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Tama ka.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.23,1:09:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.90,1:09:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito ang uniberso.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.61,1:09:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.44,1:09:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.78,1:09:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung tungkol saan ito\Nis, pero aalis na ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.29,1:09:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.29,1:09:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Huwag subukang laktawan ang kasal...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}dahil lang nawalan ako ng memorya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.67,1:09:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Dahil nawalan ako ng memorya, maaari na akong magsuot muli ng damit-pangkasal.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.76,1:09:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Isinulat ko ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.34,1:09:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pwede yun.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.39,1:09:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko ba talagang magpakasal ulit\Nyung lalaking may karelasyon...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.76,1:09:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,sa likod ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.23,1:09:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pwede.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.23,1:09:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.27,1:09:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ka sana.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.69,1:10:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo sana ginawa ito...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.82,1:10:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,kung talagang niloko kita,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.95,1:10:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya simulan ang pagdududa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.20,1:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo kailangang maniwala sa akin,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.37,1:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,pero wag ka rin maniwala kay Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.58,1:10:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag maniwala sa sinuman. Pag-aalinlangan sa lahat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.79,1:10:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eun-sung...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.54,1:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi ka kailanman pinoprotektahan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.92,1:10:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Inihiwalay ka niya sa pamilya mo at sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.56,1:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mabuti na lang at wala kami sa sasakyan,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.02,1:10:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pero akala ko ikaw,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.15,1:10:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}kaya sumakit ang kamay ko habang sinusubukang basagin ang bintana.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.53,1:11:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,May mali ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.66,1:11:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.12,1:11:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala ka sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.96,1:11:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,May tanong ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.63,1:11:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.42,1:11:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkakaroon ako ng isa pang\Nglass. Gusto mo ba ng isa?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.13,1:11:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.85,1:12:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mayroon kang hindi pa nabuksang footage\NPanoorin ngayon{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.16,1:12:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Trust Camera{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.82,1:12:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.74,1:12:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ba tayo sa U.S.?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.54,1:13:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Kaming dalawa...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.25,1:13:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,ay iniwan ng aming mga pamilya,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.46,1:13:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.38,1:13:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,tayo na lang...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.25,1:13:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,umalis.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.34,1:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari tayong magkaroon ng masayang buhay doon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.80,1:13:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ka bang inabandona ako?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.77,1:13:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang mali?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.23,1:13:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo nagsisinungaling ako?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.90,1:13:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.24,1:13:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-usap ulit tayo...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.03,1:13:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,kapag matino ka na.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.74,1:13:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,May tanong ka sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.46,1:13:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko na yata kailangan magtanong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.30,1:13:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.82,1:14:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Na, ako ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.95,1:14:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nawala ko ang aking lumang telepono,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.45,1:14:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.12,1:14:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,maari mo bang bigyan ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.16,1:14:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Number ni Baek?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.12,1:14:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, i-text mo sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.61,1:14:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Secretary Na\NHeto ang numero ni Direk Baek{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.86,1:15:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Direktor Baek{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.08,1:15:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.67,1:15:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ito, Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.30,1:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan kitang makausap.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.34,1:15:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ka?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.85,1:15:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, malapit na ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.74,1:15:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Recipient Hae-in Hong{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.83,1:16:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kay Baek Hyun-woo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.75,1:16:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Malamang na binabasa mo\Nito habang nasa operasyon ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.88,1:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kung mabigo ako...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.47,1:16:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}upang magising,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.84,1:16:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}kung gayon, maaaring ito ang aking kalooban.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.31,1:16:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi ko hihilingin sa iyo na magluksa\Nsa tatlong taon tulad ng nakaraan,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.85,1:16:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}pero gusto kong ma-miss mo ako...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.98,1:16:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}sa buong apat na season,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.36,1:16:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}at tawagan ako kapag lasing ka,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.15,1:17:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}ngunit pagkatapos noon,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.95,1:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}kalimutan mo ako at mabuhay ang iyong buhay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.28,1:17:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Maibigan nang buong puso, magpakasal,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.95,1:17:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}at magkaroon ng sarili mong pamilya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.79,1:17:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nangangako akong hindi ako magseselos.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.05,1:17:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nagseselos na ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.30,1:17:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Para sa aking mga asset,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.97,1:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}gastusin sila kung paano mo iniisip na angkop.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.72,1:17:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Iniisip na baka mamatay ako...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.10,1:17:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}nagmamadali ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.52,1:17:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Maaari ba akong pumunta sa langit kung nagmamadali akong\Ngumawa ba ako ng mabubuting gawa?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.31,1:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sa ganoong paraan makikilala kita muli.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.48,1:17:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Iniisip ko lang ito...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.40,1:17:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}nakakalungkot ako,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.07,1:17:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}pero...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.87,1:17:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}paano kung matagumpay ang operasyon,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.74,1:17:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}pero nakalimutan ko kung sino ka?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.67,1:17:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Paano kung tratuhin kitang parang estranghero?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.25,1:18:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}O mas masahol pa,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.92,1:18:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}paano kung pagmalupitan kita?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.05,1:18:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Paano kung hindi mo na kaya\Nanymore, at magkasakit ka sa akin?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.84,1:18:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ano ang dapat kong gawin?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.68,1:18:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kahit na mangyari iyon,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.56,1:18:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}huwag kang magalit sa akin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.77,1:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Huwag mapagod.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.85,1:18:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Patuloy na mahalin ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.53,1:18:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hindi magbabago ang ideal type ko,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.36,1:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}kaya mahuhulog ulit ako sa iyo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.53,1:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sabi mo ako ang gusto mong tipong palagi,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.32,1:18:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}at mahuhulog ka ulit sa akin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.74,1:18:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Napakatitiwala mo,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.24,1:18:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}kaya naisip ko na makikilala mo ako sa lalong madaling panahon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.37,1:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mangyaring maging matiyaga hanggang doon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.79,1:18:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi na tayo magkikita.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.17,1:18:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Magkikita tayong muli,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.30,1:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}dahil hindi ako susuko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.05,1:18:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mananatili ako sa iyo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.22,1:18:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Nang sa wakas ay naalala na kita,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.44,1:18:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}magpakasal ulit tayo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.49,1:19:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}At Hong Hae-in,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.41,1:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}kung binabasa mo ito,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.16,1:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}dapat ibig sabihin ay matagumpay ang operasyon\Nand wala kang maalala,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.96,1:19:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}kaya hayaan mo akong ipakilala siya sa iyo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.84,1:19:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kayang ayusin ni Hyun-woo ang anuman,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.43,1:19:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ito ay isang tray. Kailangan mo lang itong hilahin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.60,1:19:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- ...pero ang dami niyang makulit.{\c}{\i0}\N{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Ms. Hongi.{}\c
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.10,1:19:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Alisin ang papel kung nakalagay ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.48,1:19:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit mo ito sisipain?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.90,1:19:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dahil na-stuck ang papel.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.69,1:19:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ginagawa ko ang Heimlich maneuver.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.40,1:19:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pakiusap huwag itong sipain.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.20,1:19:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Humingi lang ng tulong sa akin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.08,1:19:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi ba masakit ang iyong mga paa?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.83,1:19:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Well...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.08,1:20:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kaunti na lang.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.76,1:20:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dapat ko bang tingnan ito?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.77,1:20:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Madali siyang lokohin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.60,1:20:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mr. Baek, alam mo ba?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.40,1:20:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}May raccoon na nakatira sa aming rooftop garden.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.11,1:20:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ang kanyang pangalan ay Yeong-suk.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.61,1:20:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yeong-suk.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.41,1:20:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Pwede siyang magpa-cute kapag\Nsiya ay lasing, kaya mag-ingat.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.45,1:20:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Imbes na siya ang umiinom ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.79,1:20:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ginawa ko ba kayong hindi komportable doon?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.75,1:20:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Akala ko patay ka na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.34,1:20:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hinihila niya ang puso mo kapag umiiyak siya,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.28,1:20:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}kaya huwag mo siyang paiyakin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.55,1:20:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Napaka-sexy niya nang nakataas ang manggas,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.68,1:20:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}kaya takpan mo siya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.18,1:21:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kung nalilito ka pa rin,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.56,1:21:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}tandaan mo lang ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.90,1:21:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Siya ang dahilan...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.52,1:21:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ayokong mawalan ng memorya,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.03,1:21:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}at kahit na ginawa ko,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.07,1:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}siya ang dahilan kung bakit gusto kong mabuhay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.29,1:21:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Si Baek Hyun-woo ang taong...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.54,1:21:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Gusto kong maalala magpakailanman.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.76,1:21:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sobrang saya ko na kasama ko siya.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.22,1:21:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Desperado akong nagdarasal...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.85,1:21:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}na mananatili siya sa iyo...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.98,1:21:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&} masyadong.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.15,1:21:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.34,1:22:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.65,1:22:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.20,1:22:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Manatili ka diyan! sasama ako sayo!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.27,1:23:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.44,1:23:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.55,1:24:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinundan ko sina Mr. Yoon at Ms. Hong sa Germany.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.39,1:24:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Una sa lahat, masigasig niya itong inaalagaan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.44,1:24:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumasok na ba tayo kung nilalamig ka?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.32,1:24:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.36,1:24:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Madali lang nilang nalampasan\Nas a match made in heaven,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.20,1:24:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi nila kayang lokohin ang matatalas kong mata.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.37,1:24:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Hayaan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.29,1:24:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.80,1:25:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Hayaan mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.89,1:25:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang. Kaya kong maglakad mag-isa.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.39,1:25:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ang isang babae ay hindi kailanman tumatanggi sa tulong ng isang lalaki...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.94,1:25:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,kung may nararamdaman siya para sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.48,1:25:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinusubukan niyang isali siya,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.86,1:25:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,pero matigas si Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.94,1:25:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam pa rin ng puso niya,\Nsa kabila ng pagkawala ng alaala niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.07,1:25:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hindi ako attracted sa kanya."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.40,1:25:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bilang resulta, Mr. Yoon...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.07,1:25:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,ay nangungulila sa pagmamahal na hindi nasusuklian,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.49,1:25:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,ang pinakamalungkot na uri ng pagmamahal.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.08,1:25:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikitungo siya sa isang malungkot, hindi nasusuklian na pag-ibig.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.25,1:25:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan ang conclusion ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.92,1:25:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi mo bang malapit na silang maghiwalay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.00,1:25:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kanilang relasyon ay tiyak na magwawakas,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.46,1:25:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit maaari siyang seryosong kumilos\Nout kapag dumating na ang katotohanan.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.92,1:25:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kailangan nating mag-ingat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.86,1:26:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maaari siyang magdulot ng panganib sa ating lahat.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.49,1:26:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.69,1:26:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Buhay ba siya?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.74,1:26:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Patay na ba siya?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.28,1:26:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Salamat...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.53,1:26:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}para laging nananatili sa akin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.37,1:26:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Kahit anong mangyari...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.54,1:26:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Baek Hyun-woo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.04,1:26:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Poprotektahan ko siya.{\i0}
